(195, 58, 424, 406, 5, 'Tonight\'s guest will be brought in directly from the dream house: Carina Berg!', 'Carina is a TV presenter, most recently known for her home renovation show, <em>Bergs dromkak</em> [‘Berg’s Dream House’].'),
