(209, 58, 427, 79, 4, 'The character actor behind Doctor Mugg: Marko Lehtosalo.', 'Marko plays the character Doktor Mugg in the Swedish children\'s television series of the same name. The series takes place in the fictitious town Dasseborg (\'Outhouseburg\') and revolves around toilet humour, with \'mugg\' and \'dass\' being colloquial terms for toilet in the Swedish language.'),
(210, 58, 427, 292, 5, 'Back to wreak havoc with the whole panel: Marcus Berggren.', NULL),
