(220, 58, 429, 411, 5, 'And this week\'s guest is the P1-journalist raised on spettekaka: Johar Bendjelloul!', 'P1 is a nation-wide radio station. Spettekaka (‘spit cake’) is cake prepared on a spit, primarily in southern Sweden.'),
(221, 58, 430, 404, 1, 'Linnéa \'Combine Harvester\' Wikblad.', 'This nickname is a reference to <a href=\"/attempt.php?id=6686\">Linnéa’s attempt</a> at the ‘<a href=\"/task.php?id=2526\">Render the task brief unreadable</a>’ task in episode 7 of the season.'),
(222, 58, 430, 403, 2, 'Henrik \'Egg-Eater\' Nyblom.', 'This nickname is a reference to <a href=\"/attempt.php?id=6695\">Henrik’s attempt</a> at the ‘<a href=\"/task.php?id=2529\">Quietly eat the egg</a>’ task in episode 8 of the season.'),
(223, 58, 430, 405, 3, 'Nikki \'Fast Corn Woman\' Amini.', 'This nickname is a reference to <a href=\"/attempt.php?id=6640\">Nikki’s attempt</a> at the ‘<a href=\"/task.php?id=2516\">Become a superhero and save the child</a>’ task in episode 6 of the season.'),
(224, 58, 430, 79, 4, 'Marko \'No Kidnapping\' Lehtosalo.', 'This nickname is a reference to <a href=\"/attempt.php?id=6629\">Marko and Linnéa’s attempt</a> at the ‘<a href=\"/task.php?id=2514\">Take a picture from the farthest distance</a>’ task in episode 6 of the season.'),
(225, 58, 430, 412, 5, 'And here to represent this season\'s guests, the all-but-antique Anne Lundberg!', 'Anne has presented the TV show <em>Antikrundan</em>, the Swedish version of the British show <em>Antiques Roadshow</em>, since 2000.'),
(226, 84, 566, 493, 1, 'The hectic humourist, Charlotta Björck!', NULL),
(227, 84, 566, 496, 2, 'The glamorous gourmand, Mauri Hermundsson!', 'Mauri runs the food-focused <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@UppdragMat\">Uppdrag: Mat</a> (Mission: Food) YouTube channel.'),
(228, 84, 566, 492, 3, 'The commended podcaster, Behrouz Badreh!', 'Behrouz hosts a podcast with former Bäst i Test contestant <a href=\"/person.php?id=203\">Anis Don Demina</a>.'),
