(275, 84, 575, 494, 5, 'The jack-of-all-games: Johan Petersson!', NULL),
(276, 57, 454, 329, 1, 'Born in July 1989, she’s 160cm tall, has green eyes, hates to lose, and loves to sing ‘Let it Go’ from ‘Frozen’. And that’s what I always tell her, when she doesn’t win an episode: ‘Let it go.’ Yet, she insults me anyway. It’s Inês Aires Pereira!', NULL),
(277, 57, 454, 328, 2, 'Born in Angola in June 1985, he’s 180cm tall, and is trained in International Relations and Political Analysis. Likes to eat <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.tasteatlas.com/muamba-de-galinha\">muamba chicken</a>, but he doesn’t really go into the kitchen. Why? Because he likes it to look clean, and that’s why it’s best to not even step into it. It’s Gilmário Vemba!', NULL),
(278, 57, 454, 330, 3, 'Born in December 1985, she’s 172cm tall, has brown eyes, speaks four languages, and her teenage crush is the actor Jake Gyllenhaal, who never really cared back for her. His loss, but a friend of mine’s gain. Jessica Athayde!', NULL),
(279, 57, 454, 327, 4, 'Born in February 1963 in Sétubal, he is a man who loves a lot of things. He loves to eat well, he loves to see people happy, he loves his <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vit%C3%B3ria_F.C.\">Vitória FC</a>, loves Daniela, and the truth – let’s face it – is that we all love him too. Show your love for Toy!', 'Daniela is Toy’s wife.'),
(280, 57, 454, 441, 5, 'Born in April 1981 in São João de Madeira, he is an old football star, and now a television star. He started as a commentator on football and transfers, but the fact that he’s able to tell stories like few in this country can made him transfer to Channel 11, where he has a wonderful show called ‘Cândido On Tour’, where he travels all over the country. Today, the roads have brought him here to Taskmaster, and gosh darn it, I couldn’t be happier. Ladies and gentlemen, Cândido Costa!', 'Cândido played for several different football clubs during his career, primarily as a right winger. At one point, he played for Toy’s beloved Vitória FC.'),
(281, 57, 455, 329, 1, 'A women that says that inside of her there’s Neuza, Aninhas, Chica and Goofy, a drug dealer. And when she’s alone with her boyfriend, what voice does he ask for? ‘Love, pretend you’re Goofy’. Everyone has their kinks. She’s Inês Aires Pereira!', 'Neuza, Aninhas, Chica and Goofy are all characters that Inês has portrayed.'),
(282, 57, 455, 328, 2, 'Someone who was a mercenary apprentice, helper of a mason, translator for a company, and tutored the neighbourhood kids in his backyard. Now we mention it, he says that one of those kids still owes him money. Yes, we’re talking to you. Pay your dues, sir! Ladies and gentlemen, Gilmário Vemba! ', NULL),
(283, 57, 455, 330, 3, '<em>Thirst for Revenge</em>. That’s not only the title of a 2015 movie with Rosamund Pike, but also what went through the mind of this contestant when she was told that today’s guest is the women who took her Globo de Ouro. Tonight she has a thirst for vengeance. It’s Jessica Athayde! \r\n', '<em>Thirst for Revenge</em> was originally titled <em>Return to Sender</em>. In 2022, both Jessica Athayde and Gabriela Barros were nominated for a Globo de Ouro award (‘Golden Globe’) in the ‘Best Actress – Fiction’ category, but Gabriela won the award for her performance in the series <em>Pôr do Sol</em>.'),
(284, 57, 455, 327, 4, 'A man who has a career spawning over three decades, and says he has always been honest and spoken like a lunatic. My dear, it’s not just how you speak. You also behave like a lunatic, and that’s why the country loves you. It’s Toy, ladies and gentlemen!', NULL),
(285, 57, 455, 442, 5, 'Tonight’s guest is living through an amazing phase of her career. She was in the show <em>Vanda</em>. She was a star on the second season of <em>Pôr do Sol</em>. She won a Globo de Ouro. And, on top all that... above all else, she won this year’s award from Cambridge School for the best ever impression of Sarah Ferguson. It’s Gabriela Barros!', '<em>Vanda</em> is a show about a mother who robs banks. In 2022, Gabriela won a Globo de Ouro award (‘Golden Globe’) in the ‘Best Actress – Fiction’ category, for her performance in the series <em>Pôr do Sol</em>. It\'s not known whether she has performed an impression of Sarah Ferguson (the Duchess of York), or whether a reference is simply being made to the fact that they are both women with red hair. Cambridge School appears to be an international Portuguese school, so the relevance of this is unclear.'),
(286, 57, 456, 329, 1, 'A woman who enjoys simplicity, but won’t deny herself a more elaborate make-up, with colourful shadows and lit skin. On her hair, she goes with ‘beach waves’, after having previously gambled with fringe. These are the things you read on the internet about Inês Aires Pereira!', NULL),
(287, 57, 456, 328, 2, 'A man who has a lot of brothers. A lot of brothers. In total, he has 16 siblings. And we’ve been told that next week, all the brothers, cousins, uncles, and nephews of this man will come to watch Taskmaster. Due to that, next week’s Taskmaster will be recorded in the Altice Arena. Applause for Gilmário Vemba!', 'The Altice Arena has a seating capacity of 20,000.'),
(288, 57, 456, 330, 3, 'A woman that won’t stop surprising us. Here on Taskmaster, she has shown her talents at, for example, the lip harmonica. She has also shown her skill at drawing on top of a horse. But she’s also an artist at home. Recently, she cut the hair of her son, Oliver. It went so well that tomorrow she has customers for a mise at 3pm, a balayage at 5pm, and soft gel at 7:30pm. It’s Jessica Athayde, ladies and gentlemen!', 'Vasco is referencing Jessica’s <a href=\"/attempt.php?id=5812\">attempt at the ‘Spectacularly deliver the task to Nuno</a>’ task and her <a href=\"/attempt.php?id=5802\">attempt at the ‘Paint a horse while riding a horse’ task</a>, respectively (both in season 1).'),
(289, 57, 456, 327, 4, 'A singer with a lot of years in his career. Going back a bit, the first payment he got was from the Portuguese Society of Writers. 200$ and some change. At the time, it was a fortune. Nowadays, that would allow us to have half a tank of gas, a sandwich, and a pear juice from a petrol station in Antuã. Ladies and gentlemen, it’s Toy!', 'Vasco is referencing the escudo, a currency that was used in Portugal until 2002, when it was replaced by the euro.'),
(290, 57, 456, 448, 5, 'Born in Évora, we know him as an actor, a theatre director, and a musician. He used to study Law, but he quit, because, in his words, he would never be happy being stuck in an office. And as the old Alentejano saying goes: ‘For you to be happy, being a lawyer is a chore, instead, in the Taskmaster’s house, you must do what has never been done before!’. Applause for Rui Melo!', 'Alentejo is a region in southern Portugal.'),
(291, 57, 457, 329, 1, 'A woman who has confessed that for a long time, she took baths in her apartment with the window wide open. To the entire world, she’s Inês, but to the neighbours, she’s the kinky girl from the third floor. Ladies and gentlemen, Inês Aires Pereira!', NULL),
(292, 57, 457, 328, 2, 'A young man who grew up during Angola’s Civil War. He went through so much that he made a show called ‘Immortal’. About that topic, Gilmário says that if he has to die, don’t make him run, because he doesn’t want to die tired. Ladies and gentlemen, Gilmário Vemba!', 'The <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angolan_Civil_War\">Angolan Civil War</a> started in 1975 and ran intermittently until it officially ended in 2002.'),
(293, 57, 457, 330, 3, 'A woman who speaks openly about everything. She has spoken about the libido of a postpartum woman, and she has confessed that her son was conceived on Diogo’s couch. Hi Diogo, how are you? And now is when the people who have sat on that couch over the last three years will say ‘Ewww!’. Ladies and gentlemen, Jessica Athayde! ', 'Jessica’s partner, and the father of her son, is the actor and model <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diogo_Amaral\">Diogo Amaral</a>.'),
(294, 57, 457, 327, 4, 'The artist who, as we have mentioned before, was early in almost everything. And now – don’t try this at home, okay little ones? Toy was 13 when he drank too much for the first time. He went to the hospital, and when he woke up at home, he said ‘I want seafood’. As my Aunt Helena used to say, ‘After getting wasted, crab is well tasted’. Ladies and gentlemen, it’s Toy!', NULL),
(295, 57, 457, 449, 5, 'One of the biggest musical acts in the country, and one of my favourite people. She started in ‘Popeline’, and was even in ‘Onda Choc’, despite having an audition with a 40°C fever that left our mythical Ana Faria in shock. Ana, get ready to see the tasks done by this woman today and then, trust me, you’ll be shocked. Ladies and gentlemen, Marisa Liz!', '<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Popeline\">Popeline</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Onda_Choc\">Onda Choc</a> were 1990s child/teen singing groups. <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ana_Faria\">Ana Faria</a> is a former singer – and later, producer – of children’s music, who despite being retired, is still very well-known.'),
(296, 57, 458, 329, 1, 'A woman who already knew what she wanted to be when she was a kid. Just the other day, I saw a wonderful video of Catarina Furtado calling to the stage, in Porto, a 10 year old Inês. And who would have guessed that such an angelic little girl would become, in some tasks, Beelzebub in person? Ladies and gentlemen, Inês Aires Pereira!', '<a href=\"/person.php?id=540\">Catarina Furtado</a> is an actress and presenter who later appears as a guest contestant in <a href=\"/episode.php?id=602\">episode 1 of season 4</a>.'),
(297, 57, 458, 328, 2, 'A man who isn’t just an amazing guy, but also a huge comedic talent who travels around the entire country, performing in his sold out shows. And he says that he really has to do them, because only Beyoncé can stop for two or three years. Gilmário, she might be Beyoncé, but she doesn’t lock Markl in a shed like you do. Ladies and gentlemen, Gilmário Vemba!', 'Vasco is referencing Gilmário’s actions during the ‘<a href=\"/task.php?id=3070\">Prevent Markl from scoring a goal</a>’ task.'),
(298, 57, 458, 330, 3, 'A woman who confessed that one of the first things she was told when she started to work as an actress was: ‘Kissing a man, a woman, or a wall, is the same thing’. Jessica, let me tell you that I recently caught Markl French-kissing stucco. It isn’t quite the same thing. Ladies and gentlemen, Jessica Athayde!', NULL),
(299, 57, 458, 327, 4, 'A man who is so beloved in his hometown that he was once called to give a pep talk to Vitória FC players after their coach got fired. Careful, Mourinho. Attention, Ruben. Get out of the way, Paulo Fonseca. One of these days, we’ll have in football Mister Toy!', NULL),
(300, 57, 458, 450, 5, 'One of the biggest names in comedy. A friend, and for the last few months, one of my tennis buddies. I really enjoy people who value the good things they do. And Salvador’s like that. When he scores a nice point, he shouts ‘Beautiful!’. And it’s beautiful that he’s here. Ladies and gentlemen, Salvador Martinha!', NULL),
(301, 57, 459, 329, 1, 'Born in Porto, she recently became a mom for the second time, and confesses that she can’t sleep. But wait, that has nothing to do with the baby, but instead is due to the trauma of having lost the first season of Taskmaster to Toy. Inês Aires Pereira!', NULL),
(302, 57, 459, 328, 2, 'Someone who, when he was a kid, saw Chris Rock doing stand-up. And he thought that, in his own words, it was ‘funny’ and ‘clever’. Curiously, tonight he told me that he wants to be the champion of the second season of Taskmaster, so he could ‘celebrated’ and ‘scrubate’ in his ‘coleages’ faces. It’s Gilmário Vemba!', 'Vasco uses several nonsense words that sound close to the words they’re meant to be during this introduction; this English translation is an interpretation of how this might sound to Portuguese listeners.'),
(303, 57, 459, 330, 3, 'A woman who, in a recent interview with Notícias Magazine, said – and I quote: “I’m ready to only count on myself.” Clearly someone who understood from the first season of this show that, during the tasks, Nuno Markl doesn’t help anyone. Ladies and gentlemen, Jessica Athayde!', 'Vasco is specifically referencing <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.noticiasmagazine.pt/2022/jessica-athayde-estou-preparada-para-contar-so-comigo-eu-sou-o-meu-plano-b/historias/277911/\">this interview</a>.'),
(304, 57, 459, 327, 4, 'One of the biggest singers in our country, who confessed that he thinks the term ‘pimba’ is really silly, because ‘pimba’ doesn’t translate into any other language. I would love it if he was in France and started the movement ‘Le Pimbat’, and in Germany, of ‘Das Pimben’. Applause for the amazing Toy!', 'Toy is a <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pimba\">pimba</a> singer. Pimba is a Portuguese genre of music with an up-tempo style and folk song features. It features lyrics which are silly, sentimental, and often sexual.'),
(305, 57, 459, 451, 5, 'One of the faces of this channel. One of the most loved persons by all Portuguese people. She’s called ‘Taninha’. She’s called ‘Tanocas’. And she responds by calling our Gilmário ‘Gervásio Vemba’. It’s Tânia Ribas de Oliveira!', 'In November 2021, during <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/tv/CWHF-GMIq3v/\">an interview</a> with the Angolan singer <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anselmo_Ralph\">Anselmo Ralph</a> (who, at the time, was touring with Gilmário), Tânia got Gilmario’s name wrong twice, first calling him “Gilmário Vieira”, and then “Gervásio”. Anselmo (and Gilmário) found it funny, with Anselmo demanding to know what the producers were putting in Tânia’s water.'),
(306, 72, 556, 464, 1, 'A woman who has already had one experience on TV, on another channel. Recently, a follower sent her this message: ‘I really enjoy watching you. When will you be back on TV?’. And the answer this woman gave was ‘If everything goes right, never!’. Fortunately, things didn’t go well, because she’s here. Ladies and gentlemen, by popular demand: Madalena Abecasis!', NULL),
(307, 72, 556, 441, 2, 'A man who’s been treated in a lot of ways. There are those who call him ‘Viking’. And those who call him ‘Spartan’. Those who call him ‘Candinho’, and those who call him ‘CC’. But if you remember what he did when he was our guest during season 2, it’s with unrestrained pleasure that I say that returning to Taskmaster is the ‘Mop Man’. Ladies and gentlemen, he is Cândido Costa!', 'During his attempt at the ‘<a href=\"/task.php?id=3071\">Sort the objects with your face</a>’ task in season 2, episode 1, Cândido used his entire head to sweep across the table several times, making a mess of his hair and face. This lead to Vasco dubbing him a ‘human mop’. Footage from this attempt is shown at the end of Vasco’s introduction in this episode.'),
(308, 72, 556, 442, 3, 'One of the biggest actresses in Portugal. She’s drama, she’s comedy, she’s a Golden Globe winner, but during a recent talk, she says she worries a lot about the judgment of others. Oh, girl. Your suffering is just starting. She was the first guest of Taskmaster to ever win an episode, and has deservedly become a fixed contestant in that armchair. It’s Gabriela Barros!', NULL),
(309, 72, 556, 465, 4, 'Born in São Luís do Maranhão, he came to Porto 13 years ago. I did the maths. He’s a designer. He’s a reporter on RTP. Once in a while he acts. And he also says that once in a while he gets some pretty crazy stuff in his DMs on Instagram. But let’s not talk about the nudes Markl took, to convince him to be here. If it worked, it worked. Applause for Wandson Lisboa!', NULL),
(310, 72, 556, 481, 5, 'When I first started as a host on RTP a few years ago, our guest was part of the cast of that show. It was ‘Feitos ao Bife’, and as such, I’m really happy to see that at the start of this season of Taskmaster, this individual is here tonight. He says that he was always a peaceful guy, but once, a few years ago, with his friends, they made a fire 3 metres tall. And what did they do? They started to throw spray cans onto it. That’s why this man is not allowed inside any Saint John’s party. He is António Ramin', '<em>Feitos ao Bife</em> (‘Made to Steak’) was a comedy talent show where six celebrities would recreate scenes from cinema, theatre, television, and music. Vasco was one of the jurors on the first season of the show, and the presenter of the second season. Festa de São João (Saint John’s Festival) is an annual celebration in Porto every June 23rd, to celebrate Saint John the Baptist. There are always lots of fireworks and bonfires – including events where people will jump over the bonfires.'),
(311, 90, 576, 500, 1, 'The most supple man, who could even be the garland on his own Christmas tree: Pier-Luc Funk!', NULL),
(312, 90, 576, 499, 2, 'A woman who will compete while pregnant, just like her idol, The Virgin Mary: Virginie Fortin!', NULL),
(313, 90, 576, 498, 3, 'The host of Survivor; I think his own tribe will vote him out of his own New Year’s Eve party: Patrice Bélanger!', 'Patrice is the host of the Quebecois version of the TV show <em>Survivor</em>.'),
(314, 90, 576, 497, 4, 'She’s as bubbly as sparkling wine: Mélissa Bédard!', NULL),
(315, 90, 576, 501, 5, 'He’s so cheap, that nobody wants him as a Secret Santa: Pierre Hébert!', NULL),
(316, 13, 94, 76, 1, 'Bianca \'The Lightning\' Kronlöf!', NULL),
(317, 13, 94, 75, 2, 'Directly from the gym showers, Kodjo Akolor!', NULL),
(318, 13, 94, 74, 3, 'Directly from a power dog walk, Pia Johansson!', NULL),
(319, 13, 94, 73, 4, 'And the man who dedicates himself to fitness, Claes Malmberg.', NULL),
(320, 13, 94, 77, 5, 'Also, each episode has a special guest. He\'s a man who thinks \'sweatiquette\' is important. Here he comes: Kalle Zackari Wahlström!', 'Kalle hosted the show \'Sweat & Etiquette\'.'),
(321, 13, 95, 73, 1, 'The hardest working man in showbiz, Claes Malmberg!', NULL),
(322, 13, 95, 74, 2, 'The woman who gave theatre sports a face, Pia Johansson!', NULL),
(323, 13, 95, 76, 3, 'Winner of both the Guldbagge and Kristallen, Bianca Kronlöf!', 'The Guldbagge and Kristallen are Swedish movie and TV awards.'),
(324, 13, 95, 75, 4, 'And here we have Mr Red Nose Day in the flesh, Kodjo Akolor!', NULL),
(325, 13, 95, 111, 5, 'But, we also need a guest in every episode. We have invited the celebrated movie star and highly appreciated actress, Eva Röse!', NULL),
(326, 13, 96, 75, 1, 'Here comes the first one: the former national karate champion, Kodjo Akolor.', NULL),
(327, 13, 96, 74, 2, 'Then the woman who\'s actually a bronze medallist in the district basketball championships, Pia Johansson.', NULL),
(328, 13, 96, 73, 3, 'And the man who devotes aeons of time to sports, preferably watching football: Claes Malmberg.', NULL),
(329, 13, 96, 76, 4, 'And then we have the woman who actually lives next door to the Ericsson Globe Arena, Bianca Kronlöf.', NULL),
(330, 13, 96, 78, 5, 'We always have a guest tasker on this show. Tonight, it\'s the permanently online TV presenter, Parisa Amiri.', NULL),
