(431, 57, 460, 329, 1, 'She’s a woman who won a legion of fans on Taskmaster, and the ‘Bicho’ Instagram lives of Bruno Nogueira. About it all, she said: ‘Suddenly, I’ve started to realise that I really had people who watched and liked me. And that’s wonderful.’ And it’s wonderful that we can count on her joy, on her madness, and even on her sulking whenever I give her low scores. It’s Ines Aires Pereira!', '<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bruno_Nogueira\">Bruno Nogueira</a> is a Portuguese comedian and actor.'),
(432, 57, 460, 328, 2, 'A man who, during the first season of Taskmaster, was mostly unknown to the majority of Portuguese. Nowadays, he’s sold out shows all over the country, he’s on the radio, he was the face of a telephone brand. Were it not for the fact that he was born in Angola, I don’t doubt that by 2026 we would be calling him ‘Your Excellency, President of the Republic’. Gilmario Vemba!', NULL),
(433, 57, 460, 330, 3, 'A beautiful girl who became a woman right before our eyes. She was Mimi on ‘Morangos com Açúcar’. She’s a mommy to her Oliver. She was Tatão in the recent remake of ‘O Pai Tirano’. But on this show, she’s simply just our Jessy. Ladies and gentlemen, Jessica Athayde!', '<em><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morangos_com_A%C3%A7%C3%BAcar\">Morangos com Açúcar</a></em> (‘Strawberries with Sugar’) was a Portuguese teen drama in which Jessica appeared between 2005 and 2007. <em><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Tyrant_Father\">O Pai Tirano</a></em> (‘The Tyrant Father’) is an iconic 1940s Portuguese comedy which was remade in 2022.'),
(434, 57, 460, 327, 4, 'A man who was a precocious child. For example, he started smoking at nine. And when his father found out, he cut his 5$ allowance. At that time, little Toy wrote the following letter to Santa: ‘Dear Santa, I’ve been really good this year. So I want LEGOs, a He-Man, and a carton of SG Gigantes.’ Your applause for Toy!', 'Vasco is referencing the escudo, a currency that was used in Portugal until 2002, when it was replaced by the euro. <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SG_(cigarette)\">SG Gigantes</a> is a brand of cigarettes.'),
(435, 57, 460, 452, 5, 'Give a warm welcome to tonight’s guest. He’s someone who I particularly enjoy. We were together a while back, at a friend’s dinner. He came to me, touched my back, and said: ‘Look, Vasco. You don’t know this, but I’m the number one fan of Greg Davies, the English Taskmaster, and what you and Markl are doing, congrats. I’m really enjoying it.’ And I thought to myself, ‘You’re so screwed.’ Now he’s really screwed! Applause for Diogo Valsassina!', NULL),
